  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cult&amp;Mediasem04</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kult&amp;Mediesem04</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kulturenheten planerar varje &#xe5;r att genomf&#xf6;ra en seminarieserie med &#xe4;mnesm&#xf6;ten, tre kultur- och tre medieseminarier. Teman 2004 f&#xf6;r seminarierna: Intellectual Property Rights, Music in Africa - in Dialogue with Social Change samt Kultur och Konflikt. En konsult (Maria Arnqvist) har anlitats som producent f&#xf6;r seminarieserien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Culture &amp; Media Division is each year planning to make a serie of seminars, i.e. topic meetings, three culture- and three media seminars. For 2004 the topics are: Intellectual Property Rights. Music in Africa - in Dialogue with Social Change and Culture and Conflict. A consult will produce the seminars in cooperation with Culture &amp; Media Division (Maria Arnqvist).</narrative>
  </description>
